1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,800
Your TV's AirPlay receiver shouldn't show you ads.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:08,700
AirBack. AirPlay receiver for Google TV.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,100
It shows up under your TV's own name. Nothing to configure.

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:23,000
You're watching something. Someone connects. AirBack comes forward.

5
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:30,900
Control Center, Screen Mirroring, tap your TV.

6
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:37,300
Mirror your Mac, iPhone or iPad. Photos, web, slides, your own videos.

7
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:43,700
Your own videos, full screen, no cable.

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,600
Stop mirroring. The TV goes back to what it was showing.

9
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:57,500
Same thing with live TV: it goes back to the input you were on.

10
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:04,900
Rename it. Keep "return on disconnect" on. English and Spanish.

11
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:11,300
No ads. No subscription. $3.99 once. Open source, GPL-3.0.

12
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:18,700
Netflix, Apple TV+ and Disney+ block every third-party AirPlay receiver. Everything else works.
